# Prarambh-1: High-Speed Static Fire DAQ & Ignition Interconnect

### 1. Instrumentation Overview
* **Primary Thrust Channel:** S-Type 100 kg (980.6 N) alloy-steel strain gauge load cell arranged in a full Wheatstone bridge.
* **Chamber Pressure Channel:** Piezoresistive industrial pressure transmitter ($0\text{--}100\text{ bar}$, $4\text{--}20\text{ mA}$ current loop or $0.5\text{--}4.5\text{ V}$ ratiometric output).
* **ADC Resolution:** 24-bit Delta-Sigma ($\Delta\Sigma$) analog-to-digital converter (ADS1220 / HX711) sampled at $80\text{ Hz}$ minimum ($1\text{ kHz}$ SPI burst capability).
* **Galvanic Isolation:** Optocoupled remote ignition circuit with dual physical keyswitches and hardware continuity test LED.

